# EXP-28: ARFF Dataset Creation, Apriori & FP-Growth Rule Evaluation in WEKA

======================================================================
  EXPERIMENT 28: ARFF DATASET & ASSOCIATION RULE EVALUATION IN WEKA
======================================================================

1. OBJECTIVE:
   To create an ARFF dataset from market basket transactions and evaluate 
   Apriori vs FP-Growth algorithms under min_support=33.3% and min_confidence=60%.

2. WEKA ARFF DATASET (hotdogs_exp28.arff):
----------------------------------------------------------------------
@relation hotdogs_market_basket

@attribute Hot_Dogs {f, t}
@attribute Buns {f, t}
@attribute Ketchup {f, t}
@attribute Coke {f, t}
@attribute Chips {f, t}

@data
t, t, t, f, f
t, t, f, f, f
t, f, f, t, t
f, f, f, t, t
f, f, t, f, t
t, f, f, t, t
----------------------------------------------------------------------

